00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:04.000
That might suck...

00:17:04.033 --> 00:17:06.833
Hey! What are you grumbling about?!

00:17:07.066 --> 00:17:09.166
Oh, uh, it's nothing!

00:17:09.366 --> 00:17:10.526
Let's see...

00:17:10.866 --> 00:17:11.526
Oh...

00:17:13.633 --> 00:17:17.273
By the way, haven't you guys
gotten the wrong idea?

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:17.970
- Huh?
- Huh?

00:17:18.266 --> 00:17:22.766
I said trial, but I didn't say
anything about fighting.

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:24.500
Huh?!

00:17:24.533 --> 00:17:27.503
You know, it's acting differently
than earlier, maro!

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:29.500
Enough grumbling!

00:17:29.766 --> 00:17:31.326
We'll take care of you at once!

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:35.330
No! This is awful!

00:17:35.366 --> 00:17:36.366
Let's go!

00:17:52.700 --> 00:17:53.830
Eat this!

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:05.370
Oh, it hurts!

00:18:05.833 --> 00:18:08.833
- What?
- What?

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:14.770
Bouquet...

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:17.300
And this thing...

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:18.570
It's a Shadow.

00:18:20.033 --> 00:18:22.173
What the heck is going on?

00:18:22.833 --> 00:18:26.133
I will explain in place of Boss Lady.

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:29.230
My name is Hippopotamus!

00:18:29.566 --> 00:18:32.126
She calls me Hippo.

00:18:32.466 --> 00:18:34.196
I am very glad to make
your acquaintance.

00:18:35.166 --> 00:18:36.196
Uh-huh...

00:18:37.066 --> 00:18:39.426
Let me get right to the explanation.

00:18:39.666 --> 00:18:42.166
Put simply, she owes you guys
a debt of gratitude.

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:43.430
A debt of gratitude?

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:49.470
As you know, she wanted to show
her appreciation to you guys for helping her.

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:54.870
From what I hear,
you two there wanted to fight, right?

00:18:55.733 --> 00:18:57.103
Come to think of it...

00:18:57.333 --> 00:18:58.773
We might have said that.

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:02.330
But how did she know what
we were talking about?

00:19:03.466 --> 00:19:09.066
Since she has the power of the Ra Clan,
she can become invisible.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:10.670
Boss Lady.

00:19:12.966 --> 00:19:15.196
- Whoa!
- Whoa!

00:19:16.866 --> 00:19:17.866
Then...

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:20.900
Then the touch that time...

00:19:23.233 --> 00:19:26.073
Isn't she sweet?

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:30.500
To think she would make
such efforts to return the favor.

00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:33.770
And so, we thought we would
lightly take you guys on, but...

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:37.670
But you didn't know that we were
Shadow Wielders as well, huh?

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:39.600
Exactly.

00:19:40.366 --> 00:19:42.296
I have the power
to transform,

00:19:42.333 --> 00:19:44.373
but am hopeless when
it comes to fighting.

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:47.600
Oh, this is what I mean by transform.

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:52.270
I can do things like this, too.

00:19:59.833 --> 00:20:02.433
Jeez! Stop causing so much trouble!

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:05.630
What shall we do about this girl?!

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:11.700
But... But, you see...

00:20:12.533 --> 00:20:13.533
Squeeze squeeze...

00:20:17.766 --> 00:20:18.766
Thanks.

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:20.070
Huh?

00:20:20.733 --> 00:20:25.073
Like I said, your heart was
in the right place.

00:20:26.433 --> 00:20:27.433
Thanks.

00:20:29.966 --> 00:20:31.396
What?!

00:20:31.766 --> 00:20:33.326
I'm...fired?

00:20:33.533 --> 00:20:34.703
Yeah! You're fired!

00:20:34.833 --> 00:20:35.833
You're terminated.

00:20:36.266 --> 00:20:39.026
Goodbye and farewell forever.

00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:43.170
Umm, by the way, why?

00:20:43.466 --> 00:20:45.826
You'd naturally get fired
for walking off the job

00:20:45.866 --> 00:20:48.096
and disappearing all day,
don't you think?!

00:20:49.066 --> 00:20:52.626
Don't be getting all full of yourself
just because you've got big boobs! Jeez!

00:20:56.333 --> 00:20:57.333
Bouquet...

00:21:01.233 --> 00:21:02.973
Why did I get fired?!

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:06.670
I just wanted to show my appreciation!

00:21:07.133 --> 00:21:09.403
Umm...well...

00:21:10.266 --> 00:21:11.596
Hey! Shu!

00:21:12.366 --> 00:21:13.026
Yes?

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:14.630
Please!

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:17.430
Help me find another job.

00:21:18.233 --> 00:21:21.233
- Well...nobody will probably hire you.
- Well...nobody will probably hire you.

00:21:21.766 --> 00:21:24.866
You know, you could hire me!

00:21:25.433 --> 00:21:28.773
It'd be okay if I get paid 800 Gold
or more per hour!

00:21:29.733 --> 00:21:32.073
I'll do my best!

00:21:32.366 --> 00:21:35.196
- Nobody will hire you, we're telling you.
- Nobody will hire you, we're telling you.

00:21:36.533 --> 00:21:37.533
Shu.

00:21:37.966 --> 00:21:39.896
Pretty please...

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:44.070
Gee... Umm... Well...

00:21:44.566 --> 00:21:46.026
What should we do, Zola?

00:21:47.833 --> 00:21:50.133
Shu was in charge on all matters
relating to this girl.

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:51.870
You should do as you like.

00:21:55.900 --> 00:21:58.070
Okay... I'm a man.

00:21:58.966 --> 00:22:00.226
As of today, you are...

00:22:01.333 --> 00:22:03.303
What?! Then...

00:22:03.333 --> 00:22:04.933
Like I'd ever say something like that!

00:22:04.966 --> 00:22:06.526
Run, guys!

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:08.570
Just a minute!

00:22:08.600 --> 00:22:10.000
Heck no!

00:22:10.033 --> 00:22:11.633
Come on! Jeez!

00:22:11.933 --> 00:22:15.573
I'll chase you to
the ends of the earth!

00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:18.370
I'll never let you get away!

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:20.970
- Wait!
- Zola! Hurry! She'll catch up!

00:22:34.433 --> 00:22:38.103
I, General Logi, have arrived...

00:22:38.966 --> 00:22:40.026
Lord Nene.

00:24:20.733 --> 00:24:23.273
Shu's party has arrived at Jibral

00:24:23.300 --> 00:24:25.070
and is enjoying the city life
in this big city.

00:24:25.300 --> 00:24:28.970
This is a great spot to bring my date.
Nice find, me!

00:24:29.000 --> 00:24:30.870
You've changed, Shu.

00:24:31.166 --> 00:24:33.896
Only you remain the same, Marumaro.

00:24:34.033 --> 00:24:36.603
Even I have changed, you know.

00:24:36.700 --> 00:24:39.230
Next time on Blue Dragon:
"The Noblewoman's Trap."
